;--------------------------------------------------------------------
; ENDING SPEAKER PORTRAITS
;
; One element per face; the 'faces' table in data/endings/ending_texts.lua
; indexes them 1-based, so element 1 = 7050,0. Time -1 on every element is
; correct - nothing animates, the .cns jumps straight to an element.
;
; The AXIS is what positions these. Crop each face with the axis that places it
; - (-51,-171) for the 308x52 strips, which is where the original art had it.
; The .cns draws the explod at the tunable offset alone, so FACE_OFFSET in
; external/mods/sfaz_ending_text.lua nudges the axis rather than replacing it.
;--------------------------------------------------------------------
